    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Level 5 Bastion Facility</em></p><p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Membership in the Bringers of Cosmic Dawn<br /><strong>Space:</strong> Cramped<br /><strong>Hirelings:</strong> 1<br /><strong>Order:</strong> Harvest</p><p>A laboratory around a vat or cauldron simmering with transformative potential.</p><p><strong>Harvest: Fluid Transmutation.</strong> You expend a Common or Uncommon potion, destroyed in the vat. After 7 days, the hireling produces your choice of a flask of Alchemist's Fire, a vial of Antitoxin, a vial of Basic Poison, or a Common or Uncommon potion of your choice.</p><p><strong>Enlarging the Facility.</strong> For 2,000 GP, it becomes Roomy: a Harvest order can expend two Common or Uncommon potions to produce two substances of your choice, which can differ.</p><p><em>Source: Arcana Unleashed.</em></p>",
